  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p>Last updated: September 2, 2026</p>

      <p>
        This website and associated SMS messaging system are operated
        by Jacob Kersey for personal software and development purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Information Collected</h2>

      <p>
        The SMS system may process information necessary to deliver
        messages, including a mobile telephone number and information
        contained in application notifications, status updates, or
        development logs.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of Information</h2>

      <p>
        Information is used to operate the personal SMS notification
        system and deliver application-related messages to the
        authorized recipient.
      </p>

      <h2>SMS and Mobile Information</h2>

      <p>
        Mobile information will not be shared with third parties or
        affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. SMS consent
        and opt-in information will not be sold, rented, or shared with
        third parties for their marketing or promotional purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

